---
import Button from "../ui/Button.astro";
---
<section class="section-sm open-science">
  <div class="shell open-science-inner">
    <p class="label" data-reveal>Open science</p>
    <h2 class="doc-heading" data-reveal>Read it. Test it. Challenge it. Improve it.</h2>
    <p class="lede" data-reveal>
  TER presents a coherent, testable architecture for economic decision making,
  interaction, outcomes, and change. We think it's broad enough to be worth
  testing across a wide range of economic problems—but important questions,
  edge cases, and implementation challenges remain.
</p>
    <p class="lede" data-reveal>
        The theory, models,
  and research tools are open so others can test them, challenge them, improve them,
  and help build TER into a more reliable and scalable economic framework.
    </p>
    <div class="button-row" data-reveal>
      <Button href="/theory/" label="Read the theory" variant="dark" />
      <Button href="/learn/" label="Try the tests" variant="ghost" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .open-science { background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); }

  .label {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    font-size: .76rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: .7;
  }

  .lede {
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    opacity: .85;
  }

  .lede-secondary {
    max-width: 50rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: .85;
  }

  .open-science :global(.button-ghost) {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-ink) 30%, transparent);
    color: var(--accent-ink);
  }
</style>
